@startuml ToggleRuleActive

title ルールトグル機能 シーケンス図

note across : **参照**: ADR-002 - DBアクセスをmessaging経由に統一\n**参照**: ADR-003 - メッセージングではDTOを使用（エンティティ不可）\nRules Pageは技術的にIndexedDB直接アクセス可能だが、\n一貫性のためmessaging経由でBackground Scriptに集約する

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #666666
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #888888

box "Rules Page - frameworks-and-drivers (第4層)" #LightBlue
  participant "ToggleSwitch" as UI
  participant "RulesApp" as View
end box

box "Rules Page - interface-adapters (第3層)" #LightGreen
  participant "ToggleRuleActive\nController" as Controller
  participant "ToggleRuleActive\nPresenter" as PresenterImpl
end box

box "Rules Page - application-business-rules (第2層)" #LightYellow
  participant "<<interface>>\nIToggleRuleActiveUseCase" as IUseCase
  participant "ToggleRuleActive\nInteractor" as Interactor
  participant "<<interface>>\nIToggleRuleActivePresenter" as IPresenter
  participant "<<interface>>\nIRewriteRuleRepository" as IRepository
  participant "<<interface>>\nITabsGateway" as ITabsGateway
  participant "ToggleRuleActive\nInputData" as InputData
  participant "ToggleRuleActive\nOutputData" as OutputData
end box

box "Rules Page - frameworks-and-drivers/messaging" #LightCyan
  participant "ChromeRuntime\nRewriteRuleRepository" as MessagingRepo
  participant "ChromeTabsGateway" as TabsGateway
  participant "GetByIdRequestDTO" as GetByIdDTO
  participant "GetByIdMessage" as GetByIdMsg
  participant "RewriteRuleDTO" as RuleDTO
  participant "GetByIdResponse\nMessage" as GetByIdRespMsg
  participant "UpdateRuleActiveDTO" as UpdateDTO
  participant "UpdateRuleActive\nMessage" as UpdateMsg
end box

box "Background - frameworks-and-drivers (第4層)" #LightGray
  participant "MessageHandler" as Handler
  participant "DexieRewriteRule\nRepository" as DexieRepo
end box

box "enterprise-business-rules (第1層)" #LightPink
  participant "RewriteRule" as Entity
end box

== トグル操作 ==

UI -> View : onToggle(ruleId)
activate View

View -> Controller : toggleActive(ruleId)
activate Controller

Controller -> InputData : new(ruleId)
activate InputData
InputData --> Controller : inputData
deactivate InputData

note over Controller, IUseCase : ControllerはInput Port（IUseCase）に依存\n（依存性逆転の原則）

Controller -> IUseCase : execute(ToggleRuleActiveInputData)
activate IUseCase

note over IUseCase, Interactor : 実行時はDI経由で\nInteractorが注入

IUseCase -> Interactor : execute(ToggleRuleActiveInputData)
activate Interactor

note over Interactor, IRepository : InteractorはGateway Interfaceに依存\n（同じ第2層内で定義）

Interactor -> IRepository : getById(ruleId)
activate IRepository

note over IRepository, MessagingRepo : 実行時はDI経由で\nChromeRuntimeRewriteRuleRepositoryが注入

IRepository -> MessagingRepo : getById(ruleId)
activate MessagingRepo

MessagingRepo -> GetByIdDTO : new(ruleId)
activate GetByIdDTO
GetByIdDTO --> MessagingRepo : GetByIdRequestDTO
deactivate GetByIdDTO

MessagingRepo -> GetByIdMsg : new(GetByIdRequestDTO)
activate GetByIdMsg
GetByIdMsg --> MessagingRepo : GetByIdMessage
deactivate GetByIdMsg

note over MessagingRepo, Handler : chrome.runtime.sendMessage\n（ADR-003: Message = type + payload）

MessagingRepo -> Handler : GetByIdMessage
activate Handler

note over Handler, DexieRepo : MessageHandler は IRewriteRuleRepository を経由せず\nDexieRewriteRuleRepository を直接呼び出す

Handler -> DexieRepo : getById(ruleId)
activate DexieRepo
DexieRepo --> Handler : RewriteRuleDTO
deactivate DexieRepo

note over Handler : MessageHandler は DTO をそのまま受け渡す（変換しない）

Handler -> GetByIdRespMsg : new(RewriteRuleDTO)
activate GetByIdRespMsg
GetByIdRespMsg --> Handler : GetByIdResponseMessage
deactivate GetByIdRespMsg
Handler --> MessagingRepo : GetByIdResponseMessage
deactivate Handler

MessagingRepo -> Entity : fromDTO(GetByIdResponseMessage.payload)
activate Entity
Entity --> MessagingRepo : rule
deactivate Entity

MessagingRepo --> IRepository : rule
deactivate MessagingRepo
IRepository --> Interactor : rule
deactivate IRepository

Interactor -> Entity : withActive(!isActive)
activate Entity
Entity --> Interactor : updatedRule
deactivate Entity

Interactor -> IRepository : update(updatedRule)
activate IRepository
IRepository -> MessagingRepo : update(updatedRule)
activate MessagingRepo

MessagingRepo -> UpdateDTO : new(id, isActive)
activate UpdateDTO
UpdateDTO --> MessagingRepo : UpdateRuleActiveDTO
deactivate UpdateDTO

MessagingRepo -> UpdateMsg : new(UpdateRuleActiveDTO)
activate UpdateMsg
UpdateMsg --> MessagingRepo : UpdateRuleActiveMessage
deactivate UpdateMsg

MessagingRepo -> Handler : UpdateRuleActiveMessage
activate Handler

Handler -> DexieRepo : updateActive(UpdateRuleActiveDTO)
activate DexieRepo
DexieRepo --> Handler : void
deactivate DexieRepo

Handler --> MessagingRepo : void
deactivate Handler

MessagingRepo --> IRepository : void
deactivate MessagingRepo
IRepository --> Interactor : void
deactivate IRepository

note over Interactor, ITabsGateway : InteractorはITabsGatewayに依存（同じ第2層内で定義）\n（責務分離: Repository=永続化, TabsGateway=タブ操作）

Interactor -> ITabsGateway : reloadMatchingTabs(updatedRule)
activate ITabsGateway

note over ITabsGateway, TabsGateway : 実行時はDI経由で\nChromeTabsGatewayが注入

ITabsGateway -> TabsGateway : reloadMatchingTabs(updatedRule)
activate TabsGateway
TabsGateway --> ITabsGateway : void
deactivate TabsGateway
ITabsGateway --> Interactor : void
deactivate ITabsGateway

Interactor -> OutputData : new(updatedRule)
activate OutputData
OutputData --> Interactor : outputData
deactivate OutputData

note over Interactor, IPresenter : InteractorはOutput Port（IPresenter）に依存

Interactor -> IPresenter : present(ToggleRuleActiveOutputData)
activate IPresenter

note over IPresenter, PresenterImpl : 実行時はDI経由で\nPresenter実装が注入

IPresenter -> PresenterImpl : present(ToggleRuleActiveOutputData)
activate PresenterImpl

PresenterImpl -> View : updateRuleInView(rule)
View --> UI : 状態更新

deactivate PresenterImpl
deactivate IPresenter
deactivate Interactor
deactivate IUseCase
deactivate Controller
deactivate View

@enduml
